  "_comment": "Menu blueprint for AF3. The generator (_tools/generate_menu.py) turns this into AF3 skinvariables widget files + a slot manifest. Slots 1101-1106 map to home menu sections. Widget paths use TMDb Helper's real widget form (widget=true + reload token), confirmed from a live AF3 capture. Provider IDs are TMDb watch-provider IDs, region US.",
